                <pb facs="0658" n="649" sameAs="frus:frus1940v02/pg649"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.20 Defense (M)/47<hi rendition="#superscript"
                        >4/22</hi>: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul at Hanoi</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Reed</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1940-06-28T12:00:00-04:00">June 28,
                            1940—noon</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your June 28, 10 a.m., and June 27, 7 p.m. The American Government definitely
                    purchased this wolfram and antimony and shipments are to be consigned to an
                    agency of the American Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
